on/source-before-run-09.json\\\",\\\"Keys\\\":\\\"head,files,sha256\\\",\\\"Header\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"head\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"88db8789e28333c7b7dcc8db078f394a262b73c3\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sha256\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"7aa4077f95cf7caee7af04c5a852a15e3f8b9198dc87ac32e5897f8689272ce1\\\\\\\"}\\\"}\\r\\n{\\\"Path\\\":\\\"logs/implementation-validation/source-after-run-09.json\\\",\\\"Keys\\\":\\\"head,files,sha256\\\",\\\"Header\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"head\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"88db8789e28333c7b7dcc8db078f394a262b73c3\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sha256\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"7aa4077f95cf7caee7af04c5a852a15e3f8b9198dc87ac32e5897f8689272ce1\\\\\\\"}\\\"}\\r\\n\"}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":2,\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"2549fb\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.2979282,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1998,\"output\":\"system-config/implementation-20261015\\\\SKILL.md:32:派工必须包括：题号、允许读取的本题目录、角色定义、已批准输入版本、具体问题、验收标准、输出路径、可写文件范围、来源限制和不得继续派生子 Agent 的约束。默认继承当前模型及推理设置，用户未指定时不替换模型。\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\SKILL.md:55:- 仅访问本题 Spec、metadata、指定基线及记录。禁止访问其他题工程，禁止检索来源项目相关修复提交、Issue、PR、补丁和副本。合法公开技术文档可查询并登记来源。\\r\\nworkflow/design\\\\implementation-plan-01.md:10:- 已读取准备来源 `workflow/setup-result.json`，SHA256 `f6b657fd93e95093a0514b53f9b0c8d7900298afeafa6bb6030fc8f924f38945`。该文件记录独立工程准备、依赖安装和初始构建，并明确未实现、未安装启动、未做功能测试；完整保留，不将其中准备构建作为本轮功能证据。\\nworkflow/design\\\\implementation-plan-01.md:11:- 禁止读取其他题工程、来源项目实现/修复历史、Issue/PR/补丁、副本、题包目录和初始化总览会话；本方案未访问这些来源。无需上游浏览。\\nworkflow/design\\\\implementation-plan-01.md:102:实现顺序：①提取 View 并补关键 id，保持原 UI/父接口；②加入阶段与页面动作 guard、受控保存包装；③改恢复单一 try/finally、首继续后配置生效、恢复两处直接 await；④加进度/状态行和派生 props；⑤编译、检查行数/类型/差异范围；⑥交独立验证角色串行操作唯一设备 `127.0.0.1:5555`。需求原件和准备来源保持原样。\\nworkflow/design\\\\implementation-plan-01.md:124:采用了本地技能 `arkts-syntax-assistant`、`hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever` 的语法/参考检索。检索脚本缺少 `references/doc_index.json`，已回退直接读取随包文档，没有修技能/全局状态。参考登记：前者 `references/en/typescript-to-arkts-migration-guide.md`（静态类型/禁止动态布局），后者 `docs/ArkTS-Language-Guide/Basic-Syntax/enumerations.md`（封闭阶段）、`concurrency.md`（Promise/await衔接）；来源类型为随技能提供的指南副本。UI API证据为本地官方SDK `D:/HarmonyDev/sdk/api23/default/openharmony/ets/component/loading_progress.d.ts:182,312,377` 和 `common.d.ts:26821`；本题 `ImportPage.ets:731–741` 是现有 LoadingProgress/文字用法。未查询外网。\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:3:description: Retrieve grounded ArkTS references for pure non-UI ArkTS work and ArkTS API usage. Use this skill whenever the user is writing, reviewing, testing, validating, running, or debugging ArkTS code and the answer should be backed by repository sources such as `docs/ArkTS-Language-Guide/`, `docs/ArkTS-API-Reference/`, the linter-derived `docs/linter/ArkTS_Syntax_Knowledge_From_Linter.md`, and the bundled lightweight lint tool docs `docs/linter/linter-cli.md` plus `linter-cli/` instead of model memory. This skill is especially useful for syntax rules, ArkTS-specific restrictions, API/module/member lookup, common-library usage, lightweight lint workflow lookup, runnable example lookup, snippet validation context, and figuring out which repository section to trust before suggesting code or fixes.\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:12:In the source repository, this skill lives under `skills/arkts-skill/`. This copied package is self-contained. Open cited markdown files under `docs/ArkTS-Language-Guide/`, `docs/ArkTS-API-Reference/`, or `docs/linter/` when you need the original context.\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:17:- ArkTS-specific syntax constraints and boundary cases summarized from `docs/linter/ArkTS_Syntax_Knowledge_From_Linter.md`\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:20:- Lightweight ArkTS lint workflow notes from `docs/linter/linter-cli.md` and the bundled `linter-cli/` package\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:28:2. Treat `docs/ArkTS-Language-Guide/` as the primary source for normative language explanations, `docs/ArkTS-API-Reference/` as the primary source for API/module/member details, and `docs/linter/ArkTS_Syntax_Knowledge_From_Linter.md` as implementation-derived evidence for ArkTS-specific restrictions and edge cases.\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:30:4. When a result comes from the linter summary, say that clearly instead of presenting it as official spec text. When a result comes from the API reference, do not treat its examples as pure non-UI snippet validation evidence.\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:50:3. Open the cited markdown file under `docs/ArkTS-Language-Guide/`, `docs/ArkTS-API-Reference/`, or `docs/linter/` if you need exact wording or more context.\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:63:- Source: <official-guide | openharmony-arkts-api | linter-summary>\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:75:- the top result is from `docs/linter/ArkTS_Syntax_Knowledge_From_Linter.md` and you still need an official guide section for broader context\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:83:This copied package bundles `linter-cli/`, so you may suggest local lightweight lint commands from this directory when validation or diagnostics are relevant.\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:84:Before first use, install its runtime dependencies inside `linter-cli/`.\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:90:cd linter-cli && npm install && npm run install-runtime-deps\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:94:cd linter-cli && node ./bin/linter-cli.js --input /abs/path/file.ets\\r\\nsystem-config/implementation-20261015\\\\hmos-arkts-knowledge-retriever.SKILL.md:110:- `docs/linter/ArkTS_Syntax_Knowledge_From_Linter.md`\\r\\nworkflow/implementation\\\\round-01.md:7:首次改码前已读 `workflow/setup-result.json`（baseline_prepare=pass、ohpm_install=pass、baseline_build=pass）和 `workflow/baseline-provenance.json`，确认官方基线准备已完成，未重新运行题包工具。已读 Spec、spec/acceptance.md、spec/baseline-notes.md、需求复审 implementation-review-01.md 和批准最终方案。未读取其他题、来源修复历史、Issue/PR、补丁/副本、题包目录或初始化总览；未创建子 Agent；未操作设备。\\r\\nworkflow/verification\\\\implementation-round-01.md:13:1. Saved endpoint is empty (run 01) or `http://127.0.0.1:18165/CHARS` (run 03), with no valid saved account/password.\\nworkflow/verification\\\\implementation-round-01.md:14:2. Fill endpoint `http://127.0.0.1:18165/B` (run 01) or `/UNSAVED` (run 03), username `spec15-fixture`, fictional password and sync password, directory `/restore-fixture`. Public input `getText` assertions match entered values. Before modal screenshot shows new endpoint, username and masked password.\\nworkflow/verification\\\\baseline-round-01.md:59:拟使用一次性虚构配置：`http://127.0.0.1:18085`，账号 `spec15-user`，密码 `BaselineOnly15!`，同步密码 `Spec15Sync!`，目录 `/baseline-spec15`。受控服务只对该目录 HEAD 返回 200，其他文件返回 404，不提供可导入备份。可设置延迟，`server-state.json` 记录阶段；`server-requests.jsonl` 逐条记录请求开始、方法、路径、虚构鉴权匹配和响应结束。\\nworkflow/verification\\\\baseline-round-01.md:65:编号来源：本题 `spec/acceptance.md`。`pass` 只指注明的已观察路径；`not_run` 不构成通过；`blocked` 表示前置环境阻断。\\n\"}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1427f-eee2-7fa1-89b4-0414974ec88c","create_time":1792117121.1681173}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
