k.\\n- Relevance: Determine what a plugin can help with from explicit user mention or from the plugin-associated skills, MCP tools, and apps exposed elsewhere in this turn.\\n- Missing/blocked: If the user requests a plugin that does not have relevant callable capabilities for the task, say so briefly and continue with the best fallback.\\n\\n\",\"provenance\":{\"type\":\"model\",\"model\":\"gpt-6.1-sol\"}},\"history_mode\":\"paginated\",\"multi_agent_version\":\"v2\",\"context_window\":{\"window_id\":\"01a1400b-7abd-7632-a99a-99941802766a\"},\"git\":{\"commit_hash\":\"88db8789e28333c7b7dcc8db078f394a262b73c3\",\"branch\":\"vg-spec15\",\"repository_url\":\"https://github.com/su-yunhe/HCUP.git\"}}}\r\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":311596300}},"started_at_ms":1792117137007,"completed_at_ms":1792117137318}}
